@startuml extraction-pipeline-sequence
User -> App : Capture Image
App -> Preprocessor : Normalize Image

par Barcode Detection
  App -> BarcodeDetector : Image → Barcodes
else Vision Language
  App -> ProviderCatalog : Confirm image-capable model
  App -> RemoteVL : Image → JSON
else Optional Web Search
  App -> WebSearch : Manufacturer/product evidence
end

App -> Merger : Merge JSON + Barcodes + Suggestions
App -> Validator : Validate
App -> User : Confirm Screen
@enduml
